body:
@manuel-rw I will not switch my branch. My friends enjoy being able to request music.

Unless @gauthier-th has an ETA I feel it would still be ideal if the existing validation was relaxed to allow the integration to function, or simply filter out 'unknown' media types, so that the integration and this widget will at least function. 

I'm not asking for full support, I just want this widget to not error out.
